  "label": "U.S. Flag as Political Symbol",
  "description": "The U.S. flag is a national symbol of the United States and is often used in political contexts to signify patriotism and official government business. The presence of the flag in the image reinforces the formal political setting and adds to the credibility of the scene, which is then used to imply that the false claims are legitimate or official.",
